{"seq":3,"slug":"procurement-supplier-management","title":"采购与供应商管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/foundations/procurement-supplier-management","wordCount":1550,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"采购与供应商管理\">采购与供应商管理</h1><p>采购（Procurement）是供应链中连接需求计划与物理执行的枢纽。它回答的核心问题是：从谁那里买、买什么、买多少、什么时候买、以什么条件买。2026 年，Agentic AI 正在将采购从&quot;执行交易&quot;的职能转变为&quot;战略源头&quot;的决策引擎——Salesforce 的 Agentforce 已经部署了自主运行的采购代理，能够独立完成供应商评估、合同谈判和订单下达。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-战略采购-vs-操作性采购\">核心概念：战略采购 vs 操作性采购</h2><p>采购活动按其战略价值和复杂度可分为两层：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 战略采购 Strategic Sourcing&#10;        A1[品类策略制定]&#10;        A2[供应商开发与认证]&#10;        A3[合同谈判与总成本分析]&#10;        A4[供应基地优化]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 操作性采购 Operational Procurement&#10;        B1[请购处理]&#10;        B2[采购订单下达]&#10;        B3[交期跟踪]&#10;        B4[发票匹配与付款]&#10;    end&#10;    A1 --&gt; B1&#10;    A3 --&gt; B2\">graph TB\n    subgraph 战略采购 Strategic Sourcing\n        A1[品类策略制定]\n        A2[供应商开发与认证]\n        A3[合同谈判与总成本分析]\n        A4[供应基地优化]\n    end\n    subgraph 操作性采购 Operational Procurement\n        B1[请购处理]\n        B2[采购订单下达]\n        B3[交期跟踪]\n        B4[发票匹配与付款]\n    end\n    A1 --&gt; B1\n    A3 --&gt; B2</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>战略采购</th>\n<th>操作性采购</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间跨度</td>\n<td>年度/多年</td>\n<td>日/周</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策者</td>\n<td>采购总监/CPO</td>\n<td>采购员/系统自动化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心指标</td>\n<td>TCO、供应风险、创新贡献</td>\n<td>订单准确率、交期达成率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 介入程度（2026）</td>\n<td>辅助分析、推荐决策</td>\n<td>全自动执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统支撑</td>\n<td>SRM、Spend Analytics</td>\n<td>P2P（Procure-to-Pay）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"kraljic-矩阵-品类差异化管理\">Kraljic 矩阵：品类差异化管理</h2><p>Peter Kraljic 在 1983 年提出的采购矩阵至今仍是品类策略的基石。它将采购品按&quot;利润影响&quot;和&quot;供应风险&quot;两个维度分为四象限：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"quadrantChart\" data-source=\"quadrantChart&#10;    title Kraljic 采购矩阵&#10;    x-axis &quot;供应风险低&quot; --&gt; &quot;供应风险高&quot;&#10;    y-axis &quot;利润影响低&quot; --&gt; &quot;利润影响高&quot;&#10;    quadrant-1 &quot;战略品 Strategic&quot;&#10;    quadrant-2 &quot;杠杆品 Leverage&quot;&#10;    quadrant-3 &quot;常规品 Non-Critical&quot;&#10;    quadrant-4 &quot;瓶颈品 Bottleneck&quot;\">quadrantChart\n    title Kraljic 采购矩阵\n    x-axis \"供应风险低\" --&gt; \"供应风险高\"\n    y-axis \"利润影响低\" --&gt; \"利润影响高\"\n    quadrant-1 \"战略品 Strategic\"\n    quadrant-2 \"杠杆品 Leverage\"\n    quadrant-3 \"常规品 Non-Critical\"\n    quadrant-4 \"瓶颈品 Bottleneck\"</pre><p><strong>战略品（高影响 + 高风险）</strong> — 如半导体芯片、稀土材料。策略：深度合作、联合研发、长期合约锁定产能。</p>\n<p><strong>杠杆品（高影响 + 低风险）</strong> — 如包装材料、标准电子元器件。策略：充分竞争、集中采购量换价格。</p>\n<p><strong>瓶颈品（低影响 + 高风险）</strong> — 如特种密封件、认证化学品。策略：保障供应连续性、开发替代源、维持安全库存。</p>\n<p><strong>常规品（低影响 + 低风险）</strong> — 如办公用品、MRO 物料。策略：最大化效率、P2P 自动化、减少采购人员介入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"总拥有成本-tco-分析\">总拥有成本（TCO）分析</h2><p>采购决策不能只看单价。TCO（Total Cost of Ownership）将供应商的隐性成本纳入评估：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">TCO = P_{unit} + C_{quality} + C_{logistics} + C_{admin} + C_{risk} + C_{inventory}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cs</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{unit}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ni</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 单位采购价格</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{quality}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 来料不良带来的返修/报废/停线成本</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{logistics}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cs</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 运输、关税、保险</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{admin}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 沟通、对账、验收的管理成本</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{risk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 供应中断的预期损失（概率 × 影响）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{inventory}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 因提前期长而多备的安全库存持有成本</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个常见案例：某国内供应商单价高出海外供应商 15%，但 TCO 反而低 8%——因为更短的提前期减少了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{inventory}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，更高的良品率减少了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{quality}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，且零关税消除了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{logistics}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cs</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的不确定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"供应商评估与分级体系\">供应商评估与分级体系</h2><p>成熟的供应商管理体系通常采用 QCD+S 评估框架：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>权重示例</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Quality（质量）</td>\n<td>30%</td>\n<td>来料合格率、PPM 不良率、质量体系认证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cost（成本）</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>价格竞争力、年度降本达成率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Delivery（交付）</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>交期准时率（OTD）、交付提前期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Service（服务）</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>响应速度、技术支持能力、变更配合度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sustainability（可持续）</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>碳排放、劳工合规、ESG 评级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年的新变化是 Sustainability 维度的权重显著上升。欧盟 CSRD（企业可持续发展报告指令）要求企业披露供应链碳足迹，这意味着供应商的 ESG 表现直接影响采购方的合规义务。</p>\n<p>供应商按综合得分分为 A/B/C/D 四级：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>A 级（战略伙伴）</strong> — 优先分配订单、参与新品开发、签订长期协议</li>\n<li><strong>B 级（优选供应商）</strong> — 常规供货、季度绩效回顾</li>\n<li><strong>C 级（改善期）</strong> — 限制新项目准入、3-6 个月改善计划</li>\n<li><strong>D 级（淘汰）</strong> — 逐步转移份额、寻找替代</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"采购数字化-从-p2p-到智能源头\">采购数字化：从 P2P 到智能源头</h2><p>采购数字化的演进路径：</p>\n<p><strong>阶段一：电子化（E-Procurement）</strong> — 将纸质流程搬到线上。代表系统：SAP Ariba、Coupa。解决的是效率问题。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段二：分析化（Spend Analytics）</strong> — 用数据分析支出结构、发现合并机会。代表工具：Jaggaer、Sievo。解决的是可视化问题。</p>\n<p><strong>阶段三：智能化（AI-Powered Sourcing）</strong> — AI 自动执行品类分析、供应商发现、风险评估。2026 年的代表：SAP S/4HANA 的 AI Copilot、Blue Yonder 的采购代理。解决的是决策质量与速度问题。</p>\n<p>第三阶段的关键突破在于：AI 代理不再只是提供推荐，而是在授权范围内自主执行——自动触发 RFQ（询价）、自动评估报价、自动生成对比报告、甚至在预设参数内自动下单。人类采购专家的角色从&quot;执行者&quot;转变为&quot;规则制定者&quot;和&quot;异常处理者&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"供应商关系管理的协同模式\">供应商关系管理的协同模式</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协同层次</th>\n<th>信息共享</th>\n<th>决策共担</th>\n<th>收益共享</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易型</td>\n<td>订单/发票</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>标准件采购</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协作型</td>\n<td>预测/库存</td>\n<td>补货决策</td>\n<td>降本分享</td>\n<td>VMI（供应商管理库存）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合作型</td>\n<td>技术路线图</td>\n<td>联合研发</td>\n<td>知识产权共有</td>\n<td>汽车 Tier-1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>联盟型</td>\n<td>全面透明</td>\n<td>战略对齐</td>\n<td>利润池共享</td>\n<td>丰田-电装模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>VMI（Vendor Managed Inventory）是 2026 年电商供应链中最常见的协同模式：供应商通过 API 实时获取品牌方的库存与销售数据，主动触发补货，品牌方只在收货时确认——这将补货决策点从采购员转移到了供应商的系统上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>采购分为战略采购（品类策略、供应商开发）和操作性采购（下单、跟单），后者正在被 AI 全面自动化。</li>\n<li>Kraljic 矩阵按利润影响和供应风险将品类分为四象限，不同象限需要差异化策略。</li>\n<li>TCO 分析应取代单纯的单价比较，将质量/物流/风险/库存成本纳入决策。</li>\n<li>供应商评估的 QCD+S 框架中，Sustainability 维度在 2026 年权重显著上升。</li>\n<li>采购数字化正进入第三阶段：AI 代理在授权范围内自主执行采购交易。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"supply-chain-architecture\">供应链网络架构与参考模型</a> — 理解采购在 SCOR Source 流程中的定位</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../cross-border-ecommerce/operations/tariff-customs-clearance\">跨境电商：关税与清关</a> — 跨国采购场景下的关税合规与清关流程</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"采购与供应商管理","id":"采购与供应商管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：战略采购 vs 操作性采购","id":"核心概念-战略采购-vs-操作性采购"},{"level":2,"text":"Kraljic 矩阵：品类差异化管理","id":"kraljic-矩阵-品类差异化管理"},{"level":2,"text":"总拥有成本（TCO）分析","id":"总拥有成本-tco-分析"},{"level":2,"text":"供应商评估与分级体系","id":"供应商评估与分级体系"},{"level":2,"text":"采购数字化：从 P2P 到智能源头","id":"采购数字化-从-p2p-到智能源头"},{"level":2,"text":"供应商关系管理的协同模式","id":"供应商关系管理的协同模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"需求计划与预测方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/foundations/demand-planning-forecasting"},"next":{"title":"库存管理与优化策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/supply-chain-management/logistics/inventory-management-optimization"}}